Title: Apache Traffic Server Downloads

The latest stable release of Apache Traffic Server is version 9.2.3, which was released on October 9, 2023. Additionally, we continue to support the LTS release train for version 8.1.x, with the current version being 8.1.9, also released on October 9, 2023. We adhere to the Semantic Versioning scheme, aiming to release patch releases frequently and minor releases as needed. Within major versions, all patch and minor releases are compatible.

When downloading from a mirror, it is important to verify the hash and OpenPGP compatible signature. You can find more information on verification [here](https://www.apache.org/info/verification.html). To validate PGP signatures, you will need the public keys from the release manager, available [here](https://www.apache.org/dist/trafficserver/KEYS). You can also browse through all releases and hash signatures in the [Apache Traffic Server Archive](https://archive.apache.org/dist/trafficserver/).

## Current v9.x Release - Version 9.2.4

Apache Traffic Server version 9.2.4 was released on April 3rd, 2024.

- [PGP Signature](https://www.apache.org/dist/trafficserver/trafficserver-9.2.4.tar.bz2.asc)
- [SHA512 Hash](https://www.apache.org/dist/trafficserver/trafficserver-9.2.4.tar.bz2.sha512)

[Download Traffic Server 9.2.4](https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.cgi/trafficserver/trafficserver-9.2.4.tar.bz2)

Version 9.2.4 is our latest stable release. For additional details, refer to the [CHANGELOG](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apache/trafficserver/9.2.x/CHANGELOG-9.2.4) and related [Github Issues and PRs](https://github.com/apache/trafficserver/pulls?q=is:closed+is:pr+milestone:9.2.4). Visit the [9.2.x News](https://docs.trafficserver.apache.org/en/9.2.x/release-notes/whats-new.en.html) for details specific to the v9.x release, including information on [upgrading to version 9.x](https://docs.trafficserver.apache.org/en/9.2.x/release-notes/upgrading.en.html).

## Current v8.x Release - Version 8.1.10

Apache Traffic Server version 8.1.10 was also released on April 3rd, 2024.

- [PGP Signature](https://www.apache.org/dist/trafficserver/trafficserver-8.1.10.tar.bz2.asc)
- [SHA512 Hash](https://www.apache.org/dist/trafficserver/trafficserver-8.1.10.tar.bz2.sha512)

[Download Traffic Server 8.1.10](https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.cgi/trafficserver/trafficserver-8.1.10.tar.bz2)

Version 8.1.10 is our latest stable release for the 8.x series. Additional details can be found in the [CHANGELOG](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apache/trafficserver/8.1.x/CHANGELOG-8.1.10) and related [Github Issues and PRs](https://github.com/apache/trafficserver/pulls?q=is:closed+is:pr+milestone:8.1.10).

